mindmap
  root((SSH quick connect))
    Settings
      Default username enabled: off by default
      Source
        Current profile Headscale login name
        root
        Custom Linux username
      Automatic connection: off by default
      Browser preference overrides deployment default
    Resolution
      Login name before first @
      Never use display name or destination owner
      Validate; missing or invalid means manual entry
    Connection
      Known host skips host prompt
      Auto on and valid username: connect once
      Auto off: prefill and confirm
      Missing host: ask for host first
    Recovery
      Visible destination and status
      Disconnect, reconnect and change user
      No automatic retry or account fallback
    Boundaries
      Existing Tailscale SSH authorization
      No password or key storage
      VNC and RDP unchanged
